---
/** Home: "AI는 이렇게 배워요" — three animated cards, pure CSS. */
---
<div class="how-grid">
  <article class="how-card card" data-reveal style="--i:0">
    <div class="how-art how-art-1" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="ex ex1">🐱<small>고양이</small></span>
      <span class="ex ex2">🐶<small>강아지</small></span>
      <span class="ex ex3">🐱<small>고양이</small></span>
      <span class="ex ex4">🐶<small>강아지</small></span>
    </div>
    <span class="how-step">1</span>
    <h3>예시를 잔뜩 보여줘요</h3>
    <p>"이건 고양이, 이건 강아지" — 정답이 달린 예시를 수천, 수만 장 보여 줘요. 규칙은 알려 주지 않아요.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="how-card card" data-reveal style="--i:1">
    <div class="how-art how-art-2" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="target">🎯</span>
      <span class="dart d1">●</span>
      <span class="dart d2">●</span>
      <span class="dart d3">●</span>
      <span class="err"><span></span></span>
    </div>
    <span class="how-step">2</span>
    <h3>틀린 만큼 조금씩 고쳐요</h3>
    <p>기계가 맞혀 보고, 얼마나 틀렸는지 점수를 매긴 뒤, 그 점수가 줄어드는 쪽으로 속을 아주 조금 고쳐요. 이걸 수없이 반복!</p>
  </article>
  <article class="how-card card" data-reveal style="--i:2">
    <div class="how-art how-art-3" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="flip">
        <span class="flip-front">❓</span>
        <span class="flip-back">🐱<small>고양이!</small></span>
      </span>
      <span class="spark s1">✨</span>
      <span class="spark s2">✨</span>
    </div>
    <span class="how-step">3</span>
    <h3>처음 보는 것도 맞혀요</h3>
    <p>배운 규칙으로 한 번도 본 적 없는 사진까지 맞혀요. 외운 게 아니라 <strong>배웠기</strong> 때문이에요.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .how-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .how-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 18px 20px 22px;
    transition-delay: calc(var(--i) * 120ms) !important;
  }

  .how-card h3 {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .how-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .how-step {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--grad-btn);
    color: var(--btn-ink);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .how-step {
    color: #041018;
  }

  .how-art {
    position: relative;
    height: 150px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(70% 80% at 50% 60%, var(--brand-soft), transparent 70%),
      var(--surface-2);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* 1: example cards stream in */
  .ex {
    position: absolute;
    top: 34px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 78px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--surface-solid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    font-size: 30px;
    animation: ex-flow 6s linear infinite;
  }

  .ex small {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .ex1 { animation-delay: 0s; }
  .ex2 { animation-delay: -1.5s; }
  .ex3 { animation-delay: -3s; }
  .ex4 { animation-delay: -4.5s; }

  @keyframes ex-flow {
    from { transform: translateX(-90px) rotate(-6deg); }
    to { transform: translateX(340px) rotate(6deg); }
  }

  /* 2: darts get closer to the bullseye, error bar shrinks */
  .target {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 46%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-size: 64px;
  }

  .dart {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 46%;
    color: var(--peach);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--peach);
    animation: dart 4.5s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }

  .d1 { --sx: -70px; --sy: -40px; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .d2 { --sx: 64px; --sy: 30px; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
  .d3 { --sx: -40px; --sy: 44px; animation-delay: 3s; }

  @keyframes dart {
    0% { transform: translate(calc(-50% + var(--sx)), calc(-50% + var(--sy))); opacity: 0; }
    10% { opacity: 1; }
    70%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%); opacity: 1; }
  }

  .err {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 14px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--surface-3);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .err span {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mint), var(--peach));
    animation: err-shrink 4.5s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes err-shrink {
    from { width: 100%; }
    to { width: 8%; }
  }

  /* 3: question card flips to the answer */
  .flip {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 86px;
    height: 104px;
    margin: -52px 0 0 -43px;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    animation: flip 4s var(--ease-spring) infinite;
  }

  .flip-front,
  .flip-back {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--surface-solid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    font-size: 40px;
    backface-visibility: hidden;
  }

  .flip-back {
    transform: rotateY(180deg);
    border-color: var(--ok);
  }

  .flip-back small {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: var(--ok);
  }

  @keyframes flip {
    0%, 35% { transform: rotateY(0); }
    50%, 90% { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
    100% { transform: rotateY(360deg); }
  }

  .spark {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 20px;
    animation: spark 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .s1 { left: 28%; top: 22%; }
  .s2 { right: 26%; bottom: 20%; animation-delay: 0.3s; }

  @keyframes spark {
    0%, 45% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.4); }
    60% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); }
    90%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.6); }
  }
</style>
